  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{起|お}こす→起こす：01234_okosu⟧ (transitive, to wake someone up). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}きる.\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {起|お}きて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is awake' (not 'is waking up'). This is important: ⟦まだ→まだ：00603_mada⟧{起|お}きて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means 'still awake.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{朝|あさ}→朝：02277_asa⟧⟦{早|はや}く→早い：00514_hayai⟧{起|お}きる (wake up early)\n- 〜⟦{時|じ}→時：09869_ji⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{起|お}きる (wake up at ~ o'clock)\n- ⟦{事故|じこ}→事故：00851_jiko⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{起|お}きる (an accident occurs - sense 2)\n- {起|お}きて⟦います→いる：00495_iru⟧⟦か→か：09473_ka⟧ (are you awake?)\n\nOpposite: ⟦{寝|ね}る→寝る：00470_neru⟧ (to sleep/go to bed).",
